# pylgrim — configuration
#
# Copy to .env.local. Only ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is required; without the
# Azure keys, audio degrades with a clear message rather than breaking.
#
# .env.local is gitignored. Never commit real values.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generation — set ONE provider
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Requests are billed to your own account; pylgrim is not in the loop.
# If several keys are set, Anthropic wins — it is what the prompts and the
# alignment were tuned against. PYLGRIM_PROVIDER overrides that.
#
#PYLGRIM_PROVIDER=anthropic              # anthropic | openai | openrouter

# Anthropic — the default path. Model is chosen per language automatically.
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...

# OpenAI. The model is REQUIRED — no default, because model names change
# and a stale one fails as though pylgrim were broken. Use a current
# frontier model that supports strict JSON schema output; smaller ones
# miscount word positions and stories stop flipping.
#OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#PYLGRIM_OPENAI_MODEL=

# OpenRouter — one key, many vendors. Same rule about the model, and it
# matters more here: OpenRouter is a router, so quality is whatever you
# routed to. See "Picking a model" in SELF-HOSTING.md.
#OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
#PYLGRIM_OPENROUTER_MODEL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Audio — optional (Azure Speech)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Key plus ONE of endpoint or region.
#AZURE_SPEECH_KEY=
#AZURE_SPEECH_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com
#AZURE_SPEECH_REGION=westeurope

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Development only
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generate through a local Claude Code subscription login instead of an API
# key. A subscription is personal auth, not a service credential — never
# use this for anything you expose.
#PYLGRIM_PROVIDER=claude-code
